  "body": "This draft stores full checkpoints, policy publications and raw records for the pinned Ouro-1.4B-Thinking native startup study on the continued H20. The study retains three updates, 96 stochastic training completions and 32 held-out completions; it has not run yet.\n\nLossless archive parts are capped at 512 MiB. Each part requires a matching server digest and independent download hash. All optimizer, scheduler and RNG state remains required. Recovery and multi-seed reward convergence are separate unfinished requirements.\n"
